                    {filteredCharacters.some(char => char.tags.includes('ç¹ï½­ç¹æ‡Šãƒ£ç¹ãE)) && (
                      <div className="flex flex-col items-start">
                        <div className="flex items-center text-xs" style={{ color: 'var(--text-secondary)' }}>
                          <span>{language === 'ja' ? 'ç¹ï½­ç¹æ‡Šãƒ£ç¹è‚²æ¼ç¸ºãƒ» 3è­ã‚‹ä¿£50è›»ãƒ»â†“éšªE­è³å£¹E ç¸ºE¦ç¸ºä¸Šâ–¡ç¸ºè¼”ï¼E : 'Robot target: set to 3h50m'}</span>
